        },
        {
          "text": "’Dini anzi Israelini yi ’ye kile Yosuani azile yi tiarile, yi o’du oni mudri drini iri engazu Yoridania agadua, kile Yehovani ’yole Yosua ma tiarile, suruti anzi Israelini ma kalafe vusi; yi o’du yi jizu yi be indi pari yini lazuria, yi o’ba yi va ’daa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
